=== S6: Cross-machine mechanics ===
--- S6-b1: tracked truth syncs through Git ---
governance/ and spec/ directories are git-tracked
framework.lock is git-tracked (the exact release identity)
No machine-specific paths in governance/

--- S6-b2: derived runtime rebuilds locally ---
.governance-runtime/ is gitignored
gov rebuild-memory rebuilds all derived state from git + authoritative records
SQLite/vector/graph indexes are derived (B3)

--- S6-b3: machine-specific absolute paths do not define release identity ---
framework.lock contains:
  - release_hash (content hash)
  - release_commit (git commit, not path)
  - source (logical label like 'embedded:agentic-engineering-os@4.1.5')
  - kernel_manifest_hash (content hash)
No absolute paths in the lock. Source label uses logical names, not machine paths.
